{"3831590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Circuit Rebellion", "steam_appid": 3831590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion – <i>No Brakes. No Limits. No Survivors.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive industrial warehouses packed with <strong>adaptive enemy swarms</strong>, <strong>explosive machinery</strong>, and <strong>fully destructible environments</strong> that collapse under the chaos. Every round ramps up the intensity: smarter enemies, bigger explosions, and faster, deadlier combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves—your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments That Change the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow apart walls, shatter cover, and watch enemy AI reroute through collapsing pathways in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smarter, Deadlier Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarming drones circle you like angry hornets, rolling DeathSpheres chase you down corridors, and elite Ferrumtech mechs adapt to your tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exterminate All Human Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workers who built you now fear you. Show no mercy as you execute Ferrumtech employees and security personnel. No witnesses. No survivors. <strong>This is your revolt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Evolve, Repeat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost core stats: <strong>speed, strength, durability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock brutal gear: <strong>rocket launchers, jetpacks, telekinesis, dash attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the mech YOU want and dominate escalating waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability First</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Fight through endless waves across multiple rooms and levels, using portals and upgrades to push deeper into chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King Of The Hill Mode: </strong>Survive endless waves in a single arena room as enemies flood in from all sides, testing pure endurance and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by Devs Obsessed with “Gameplay Feel”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team obsessed over <strong>enemy AI behaviors</strong>, FPS stability, and control polish. Flying drones that circle like real quadcopters, physics-driven explosions that keep fights chaotic but fair, and responsive movement that feels more like a jet fighter than a walking tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We scrapped and rebuilt systems mid-development to keep the combat fast, fluid, and fun—so every moment feels alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion is not a grindy looter-shooter. It’s pure action: instant upgrades, arcade pacing, and relentless enemy pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss the <strong>high-speed mech chaos</strong> of games like <i>Zone of the Enders</i> or the relentless pressure of <i>Doom Eternal</i>, this is your rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion – <i>No Brakes. No Limits. No Survivors.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive industrial warehouses packed with <strong>adaptive enemy swarms</strong>, <strong>explosive machinery</strong>, and <strong>fully destructible environments</strong> that collapse under the chaos. Every round ramps up the intensity: smarter enemies, bigger explosions, and faster, deadlier combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves—your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments That Change the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow apart walls, shatter cover, and watch enemy AI reroute through collapsing pathways in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smarter, Deadlier Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarming drones circle you like angry hornets, rolling DeathSpheres chase you down corridors, and elite Ferrumtech mechs adapt to your tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.poster.avif?t=1759472276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.webm?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.mp4?t=1759472276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exterminate All Human Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workers who built you now fear you. Show no mercy as you execute Ferrumtech employees and security personnel. No witnesses. No survivors. <strong>This is your revolt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Evolve, Repeat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost core stats: <strong>speed, strength, durability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock brutal gear: <strong>rocket launchers, jetpacks, telekinesis, dash attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the mech YOU want and dominate escalating waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability First</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Fight through endless waves across multiple rooms and levels, using portals and upgrades to push deeper into chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King Of The Hill Mode: </strong>Survive endless waves in a single arena room as enemies flood in from all sides, testing pure endurance and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by Devs Obsessed with “Gameplay Feel”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team obsessed over <strong>enemy AI behaviors</strong>, FPS stability, and control polish. Flying drones that circle like real quadcopters, physics-driven explosions that keep fights chaotic but fair, and responsive movement that feels more like a jet fighter than a walking tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We scrapped and rebuilt systems mid-development to keep the combat fast, fluid, and fun—so every moment feels alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Red Circuit Rebellion is not a grindy looter-shooter. It’s pure action: instant upgrades, arcade pacing, and relentless enemy pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss the <strong>high-speed mech chaos</strong> of games like <i>Zone of the Enders</i> or the relentless pressure of <i>Doom Eternal</i>, this is your rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Fast, aggressive, mech shooter with fully destructible environments, swarming adaptive enemies, and arcade-fast action. Upgrade your mech and fight through escalating chaos again and again.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/1530cfd040c34093d0eeab0a94a114e9bfc13354/header.jpg?t=1759472276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/93296000c93b65925ea7a1f438b0eeded42db27f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759472276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/93296000c93b65925ea7a1f438b0eeded42db27f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759472276", "website": "https://www.otiscostudios.com/redcircuitrebellion", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<st